From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:58:10 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Count event views on the admin show page

New events.views_count column (default 0, also set in the Event constructor because save() writes every column). Event::registerView increments it with update(), without validation, and the admin show calls it once per access. The count appears on the show page and in the listing.
---
